units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region box block 0 66 0 66 0 213 units box
create_box 2 box
region projectile_region block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target_region block 0 20 0 20 20 60 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile_region
create_atoms 2 region target_region
group projectile type 1
group target type 2
mass 1 92.90638
mass 2 92.90638
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz
thermo_modify lost error flush yes
velocity all create 300 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix equilibration all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
reset_timestep 0
run 100000
velocity projectile set NULL NULL 20 sum yes units box
fix production all nve
reset_timestep 0
run 100000
